0..78 Comment "// Reflexivity is a unit of `Path.step` beside a stuck transport and beside an"
79..104 Comment "// action on reflexivity."
105..107 Comment "//"
108..183 Comment "// A coherence proved by path induction reaches its base case through these"
184..244 Comment "// units, so the kernel re-derives what the checker accepts."
245..247 Comment "//"
248..322 Comment "// The associator is a transport along a variable path, so it stays stuck."
323..391 Comment "// The action of a function on reflexivity reduces to reflexivity. A"
392..468 Comment "// composite whose operand runs and sticks waits on its path, so a whiskered"
469..543 Comment "// reflexivity after the associator reduces before the associator unfolds."
544..546 Comment "//"
547..601 Comment "// - see: #3734 — the kernel\'s replay of these units"
602..655 Comment "// - see: `then.gandr` — the composite of two paths"
656..718 Comment "// - see: `transport-dependent.gandr` — based path induction"
